1cd29","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/atmosphere-atmosphere-c9302661cd29.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"atmosphere/atmosphere","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1d8a5d6574f48abd25d811da533c4341eefd473c537d96def482da856dd7a66b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Requirements are Java 21+, Spring Boot 4.1.0 or 3.5 via the -Pspring-boot3 profile, and Quarkus 3.36.3+; artifacts are published to Maven Central and atmosphere.js to npm."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1e5262574ae80babe3f511539e5876c8a6270d2afb102599dd2f1d5ac4318e3f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Multi-agent orchestration uses @Coordinator and AgentFleet with handoffs, conditional routing, an event-sourced coordination journal, and durable hibernating Workflow<S> over a CheckpointStore (optionally Temporal-backed)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_59e1042ef9426e125d9916612293db078e2cb6e1258ba03a124b50767486c5c8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI can import agent skill files, e.g. atmosphere import of an Anthropic SKILL.md URL, and a companion atmosphere-skills repository offers curated skill files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6bcef9d731bbe2026b8a197c2d7cfb552b7356f3a7787bafcc153e10c2271495"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Runtime adapter capabilities are pinned by AbstractAgentRuntimeContractTest.expectedCapabilities(), so a runtime cannot drift from its declared feature set without breaking tests."},{"claim_ids":["clm_866dbf102562ab740b8c8ed962d16fcd651a2a2ca03d871ac77d80fc8d80b761"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Governance controls include GovernancePolicy/PolicyRing with allow/deny lists and rate limits, @AgentScope purpose enforcement, tool approval policies, and a plan-and-verify verifier module."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9495451c2824285e4cdf93b4cf5acbadfd3df68688b1febe8f9c0a066640d41b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The atmosphere-ai module ships an AgentRuntime SPI with a built-in OpenAI-compatible adapter; eleven more adapters live in separate modules, two of which (Anthropic, Cohere) are native HTTP+SSE clients."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ba10976b125261eb4662d9e32927cc3641c68a9993b7d1677164a87c7d833aa6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Classpath modules register endpoints: browser endpoint at /atmosphere/agent/my-agent, MCP at .../mcp, A2A at .../a2a, AG-UI at .../agui, plus an admin dashboard and console UI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dcbd1dfe153dd5b16dd19e6fa54acf0eaac04d057dd760a6929b6e103c28a90a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Governance policy can be declared in YAML (deny-list phrases, cost ceilings) or via annotations such as @AgentScope with purpose, forbiddenTopics, and breach behavior."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f8ae665ea548119f524007c1f61b5ff38a134d5f727d987a48c53adb0c5521b8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Memory is provided as AiConversationMemory per-conversation history and LongTermMemory per-user facts, in-memory or durable via SQLite/Redis modules, with a SemanticRecallInterceptor for vector recall."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fb6713b36ffa426fdcdb8eda2035d0323e5d3e8314d5858e62985d1fde7743fb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A single @Agent annotation declares an agent, with @Prompt for streaming messages, @Command for slash commands (including confirmation prompts), and @AiTool for tool methods."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1d8a5d6574f48abd25d811da533c4341eefd473c537d96def482da856dd7a66b","clm_1e5262574ae80babe3f511539e5876c8a6270d2afb102599dd2f1d5ac4318e3f","clm_59e1042ef9426e125d9916612293db078e2cb6e1258ba03a124b50767486c5c8","clm_6bcef9d731bbe2026b8a197c2d7cfb552b7356f3a7787bafcc153e10c2271495","clm_866dbf102562ab740b8c8ed962d16fcd651a2a2ca03d871ac77d80fc8d80b761","clm_9495451c2824285e4cdf93b4cf5acbadfd3df68688b1febe8f9c0a066640d41b","clm_ba10976b125261eb4662d9e32927cc3641c68a9993b7d1677164a87c7d833aa6","clm_dcbd1dfe153dd5b16dd19e6fa54acf0eaac04d057dd760a6929b6e103c28a90a","clm_f8ae665ea548119f524007c1f61b5ff38a134d5f727d987a48c53adb0c5521b8","clm_fb6713b36ffa426fdcdb8eda2035d0323e5d3e8314d5858e62985d1fde7743fb"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","id":"pg_752af07972f3529ab5e05733dc3732bb","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/atmosphere-atmosphere-readme-md-468f0ea79d57-5733dc3732bb.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_53f2e9b934f0535a927d22c15844d65b"],"title":"Atmosphere/atmosphere/README.md @ 468f0ea79d57","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_4bd65132a66b7da93119254b1974d747dc1adb365c6872079484679e86bba8d3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: git hooks must be enabled via core.hooksPath .githooks each session; they enforce copyright headers, no unused imports, commit format, and no AI-generated commit trailers, and --no-verify is forbidden."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ad3f148d318f8c6a8c547eec161986c6edbe137402cbdf14d4cb9f9fb2570f6b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the project uses Maven with the wrapper; contributors run ./mvnw install/test, per-module builds, checkstyle and PMD checks, and must run a full compile with zero warnings before committing."}],"claim_ids":["clm_4bd65132a66b7da93119254b1974d747dc1adb365c6872079484679e86bba8d3","clm_ad3f148d318f8c6a8c547eec161986c6edbe137402cbdf14d4cb9f9fb2570f6b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","id":"pg_a34a29fff7595b25bdd262b8d74e2345","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/atmosphere-atmosphere-agents-md-468f0ea79d57-62b8d74e2345.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_9db5e1e0c09e55db8dadc410127116db"],"title":"Atmosphere/atmosphere/AGENTS.md @ 468f0ea79d57","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
